<title>UK: Vontobel sets warrants on Georg Fischer.</title>
<headline>Vontobel sets warrants on Georg Fischer.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bank Vontobel said it has issued two million American-style call warrants on bearer shares of Georg Fischer AG.</p>
<p>One share is controlled by 100 warrants.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    2,100 CHF		 PREMIUM	16.5 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     1.60 CHF		  GEARING	12.1 TIMES</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 21.MAY.97-28.AUG.98   PAYDATE	21.MAY.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWISS</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  1,940 CHF</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
